# Imports and files

## File naming

- **kebab-case**: `reconcile-sort-order.ts`, `file-explorer-row.tsx`, `use-space-files.ts`.
- Hooks: `use-*.ts` / `use-*.tsx`.
- Hierarchy in the name when it clarifies place in the tree (`file-explorer-toolbar-title.tsx`).

## Exports

Named exports for components, hooks, and utils:

```ts
export function SpaceWizard(/* … */) { /* … */ }
export function useItems(/* … */) { /* … */ }
export function updateArrayAt(/* … */) { /* … */ }
export type SpaceFile = { /* … */ };
```

Helpers beside a primary symbol are named exports too (`useItemListDispatch`, action creators). Feature entry files re-export what apps need.

## Import style

Group with a blank line between groups: external → domain hooks / util / types / constants → sibling UI.

```tsx
import { ItemList, Stack } from '@repo/react/design-system';
import { useItems } from '../hooks/use-items';
import { updateArrayAt } from '../util/update-array-at';
import { type Item } from '../util/types';
import { itemDefaults } from '../constants/item-defaults';

import { ItemsHeader } from '../ui/items-header';
```

Public package paths and shallow same-domain relatives.

- Apps import public `@repo/react/...` entrypoints.
- Cross-package: `@repo/shared`, `@repo/react/...`.
- UI kits (`@mantine/core`, …) import only inside `packages/react/src/design-system/**` primitive modules and `ui-provider/`.
- Inside a package, keep relatives shallow; hoist shared symbols to the parent domain `util/` / `hooks/` or a public subpath when subdomains need them.

